<view class="page upload-page"><view class="title">新建墙面</view><view class="page-lead">上传图片，保存为私有草稿，再标注岩点。</view><view wx:if="{{checking}}" class="empty">正在检查权限…</view><view wx:elif="{{!allowed}}" class="empty">仅管理员可创建墙面。</view><block wx:if="{{allowed}}"><view class="image-picker" bindtap="chooseImage"><image wx:if="{{imagePath}}" src="{{imagePath}}" mode="aspectFit"/><block wx:else><view class="picker-icon">＋</view><view>选择墙面图片</view><view class="muted">相册或拍照</view></block></view><button size="mini" bindtap="chooseImage" disabled="{{saving}}">{{imagePath?'重新选择图片':'选择图片'}}</button><view class="field-label">墙面名称</view><input class="field" value="{{name}}" bindinput="setName" maxlength="80" placeholder="输入墙面名称" disabled="{{saving || creationPending}}"/><view class="muted upload-hint">图片会适当缩小，便于手机浏览。发布后墙图和岩点不可修改。</view><view wx:if="{{stage}}" class="notice">{{stage}}</view><button class="button" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || !imagePath || !name}}" bindtap="submit">{{saving?'处理中…':'上传并创建草稿'}}</button></block><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-card">{{error}}</view><canvas type="2d" id="imageProcessor" class="processor"/></view>
